---
title: "Mapping ideal apps onto Google Cloud projects"
---
flowchart LR
  composio["Ideal app: Composio<br/>one trust platform"]
  rclone["Ideal app: rclone<br/>separate product"]
  cp["Project: composio-integrations<br/>one Client ID<br/>grow scopes for Google toolkits"]
  rp["Project: rclone-personal<br/>isolated consent / quotas / revoke"]
  warning["A second Client ID inside one Project<br/>is only another credential string<br/>not a separate app"]
  composio -. "stand-in" .-> cp
  rclone -. "stand-in" .-> rp
  cp --> warning
  class composio,rclone secondary
  class cp,rp primary
  class warning danger
  accTitle: Mapping ideal apps onto Google Cloud projects
  accDescr: Composio maps to one project used as a trust platform; rclone maps to a separate project.

  classDef primary fill:#ffffff,stroke:#2c2c2c,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef secondary fill:#e8f0ea,stroke:#1f3a2e,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef warning fill:#f7f3e8,stroke:#6b5a3e,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef success fill:#1f3a2e,stroke:#1f3a2e,color:#f7f3e8,stroke-width:2px
  classDef danger fill:#f6e8e6,stroke:#7a3a32,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
